msgstr "注意事项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:44
#: ad52ad4ca5b54ebb9faaf037b806a3fc
msgid ""
"When Vin of the EPM drops below 5V the EPM will go into low power mode. "
"Slowing down switching to prevent crashing the power rail."
msgstr "当 EPM 的 Vin 低于 5V 时，EPM 将进入低功耗模式，减缓切换速度以防止电源总线崩溃。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:45
#: 6da1ec168c754c4a953a5379f0834480
msgid ""
"When Vin drops below 4.5V the green status LED will blink fast indicating an"
" error condition."
msgstr "当 Vin 低于 4.5V 时，绿色状态 LED 将快速闪烁，表示发生错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:46
#: a5cbc95190284dd39600902605cf0fe1
msgid "The Pixhawk DroneCAN connector power rail voltage is < 5V."
msgstr "Pixhawk DroneCAN 接口电源总线电压 < 5V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:47
#: e92e7d5b74f840b79f5b4a282340f837
msgid "External powering of the EPM is recommended (see image above)."
msgstr "建议为 EPM 外部供电（见上方图片）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:48
#: 4c29dbc334bd4ebda4dd00655798c76b
msgid ""
"EPM DroneCAN cable set is required. `Clickmate -> DF13 "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=69&controller=product>`__."
msgstr ""
"需要 EPM DroneCAN 线缆套装。`Clickmate -> DF13 "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=69&controller=product>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:49
#: 7339e3b748814ff0bec9d30c28323748
msgid ""
"DroneCAN requires termination, terminator included in DroneCAN cable set."
msgstr "DroneCAN 需要终端电阻，DroneCAN 线缆套装中已包含终端电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:53
#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:78
#: d6ffeb78971341088efd82539cf8d58d fedaed4278744509b04a58396fdcf267
msgid "Parameter setup"
msgstr "参数设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:56
#: fc5dd7f9efb94a219311f08af286f523
msgid ""
"You need to enable the DroneCAN. The :ref:`DroneCAN setup page is here "
"<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>`. You also may check the configurations of "
"the parameters :ref:`GRIP_CAN_ID <GRIP_CAN_ID>` and :ref:`GRIP_TYPE "
"<GRIP_TYPE>` to set gripper ID and type."
msgstr ""
"您需要启用 DroneCAN。:ref:`DroneCAN 设置页面在此 <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>`。您也可以检查 "
":ref:`GRIP_CAN_ID <GRIP_CAN_ID>` 和 :ref:`GRIP_TYPE <GRIP_TYPE>` 参数的配置以设置抓手 "
"ID 和类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:58
#: 75ce9bdcc11345c0b31c0f1e0c16bbd8
msgid ""
"Save the configurations and restart the boards. After about 5 seconds the "
"RED CAN LED on the EPM will start blinking. This indicates that CAN frames "
"are being received."
msgstr "保存配置并重启飞控板。约 5 秒后，EPM 上的红色 CAN LED 将开始闪烁，表示正在接收 CAN 帧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:60
#: 9a69466ce91a4a1d82a96c75db097419
msgid "Set CH7_OPT: Channel 7 option = 19 (EPM) (Channel 7 - 12 maybe used)"
msgstr "设置 CH7_OPT：通道 7 选项 = 19（EPM）（可使用通道 7 至 12）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:65
#: 8fe0105d1d3a43f6b794a2e12fb8198e
msgid ""
"All done! The EPM can be controlled via channel 7 or AUTO mission or MAVLink"
" command."
msgstr "完成！EPM 可通过通道 7、Auto 任务或 MAVLink 指令进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:69
#: 960f0b59b0da457aa838be7fed446fb9
msgid "Connecting to a Pixhawk via PWM header"
msgstr "通过 PWM 接头连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:71
#: 816b81f6eaf744899105007bd840cd18
msgid ""
"Connect the EPM to the Pixhawk the same as a :ref:`servo <common-servo>`."
msgstr "以与 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` 相同的方式将 EPM 连接到 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:80
#: 4ffc9136651f48658ea22f4abe975834
msgid "Set CH7_OPT: Channel 7 option = 19 (EPM) (Channel 7 - 12 maybe used)."
msgstr "设置 CH7_OPT：通道 7 选项 = 19（EPM）（可使用通道 7 至 12）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:86
#: dfac53a964e64bedb4105922397b69d4
msgid ""
"All done. The EPM can be controlled via channel 7 or AUTO Mission or MAVLink"
" command."
msgstr "完成。EPM 可通过通道 7、Auto 任务或 MAVLink 指令进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:90
#: 60ebb77473514f4ca270e1fc17e1c887
msgid "Auto mission"
msgstr "自动任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:92
#: 4f0f528282ac45dd960682b989058c47
msgid "Add a *Do Gripper* command in your mission."
msgstr "在任务中添加 *Do Gripper* 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:99
#: dc85fbf451a74c78adc57566159aa0de
msgid "Magnetic interference and board voltage check"
msgstr "磁干扰与板载电压检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:101
#: 120d6c71de3c440a9c3cdbe7546b6279
msgid ""
"The EPM can cause magnetic interference especially while gripping or "
"releasing the cargo or if left in the \"on\" state with no cargo attached. "
"Magnetic interference is minimal at a distance of 10 cm"
msgstr "EPM 可能产生磁干扰，尤其是在抓取或释放货物时，或在未附载货物的情况下保持「开启」状态时。在 10cm 距离处磁干扰最小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:105
#: 521d7d2327254b24bb7472f4721cf77c
msgid ""
"Testing the EPM impact on the compass is highly recommend when mounted close"
" then 10 cm distance from flight computer"
msgstr "强烈建议在 EPM 与飞控的距离小于 10cm 时测试其对罗盘的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:107
#: 5985d24292d443bc8f624d61981e52ae
msgid ""
"The EPM's impact on the compass can be tested in real-time by connecting "
"with the Mission Planner. Go to the Flight Data screen and click on the "
"\"Tuning\" checkbox at the bottom, middle.  Double click on the graph that "
"appears on the top right and when the \"Graph This\" window appears select "
"\"magfield\"."
msgstr ""
"EPM 对罗盘的影响可通过连接 Mission Planner "
"进行实时测试。进入飞行数据页面，点击底部中间的「Tuning」复选框。双击右上角出现的图表，在弹出的「Graph "
"This」窗口中选择「magfield」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:112
#: 466e79b2dbfe44eb803b5d270e977859
msgid ""
"Turning the EPM on and off and ensure the magfield length does not change by"
" more than 10%."
msgstr "开关 EPM 并确保磁场强度变化不超过 10%。"
